{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-elimination.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-elimination","title":"消元：解出一个变量，代入目标变成一元式","note":"例：$x,y>0$，$x+2y+xy-7=0$，求 $x+y$ 的最小值。由条件解出 $y$，代入后分离成积为定值的两项。","after":"replace","version":"a4ecc06b63c4","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\">\n      <div class=\"method-template\"><span class=\"method-node\"><small>条件</small><b>二元等式</b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><small>解出</small><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>表示</small><b><var>y</var> = <span class=\"hole\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><small>代入</small><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>目标</small><b>一元式</b></span></div>\n      <p class=\"method-demo\"><span class=\"method-demo-tag\">例</span><span class=\"method-demo-body\"><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">⇒</span><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></math></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"term square\"><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"term circle\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></span><span class=\"op\">−</span><math><mn>3</mn></math></span></span></p>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\">消元后，剩下变量的范围跟着改写</p>\n    </div>"}
